    "problems": "The study focuses on small models and non-language ICL tasks, with synthetic formal-language benchmarks as proxies; the authors note that results may not transfer to real-language ICL or higher parameter counts. It does not measure induction-head mechanisms or formation.",
    "rows_left_out": "Not applicable; no rows about induction-head formation or mechanism were reported. Other task results, including regression, parity, and vector MQAR, are outside the specific behaviours measured by the claim versions.",
